   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Smokestack Lightning**: back after 57 archived shows (959 days); rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **High Time**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2022-06-17.dc2022-06-17** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 199 min [1]\n- **deadco2022-06-17.deadco2022-06-17**: source not stated; 20 songs; 198 min [2]\n- **deadco2022-06-17**: source not stated; 19 songs; 199 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2022-06-17.dc2022-06-17**: Recorded with a Soundfield ST-450 cardioid microphone feeding a Sonosax SX-R4 recorder at 24-bit/48kHz; Transfer ran from the Sonosax SX-R4 into Audacity at 16-bit/44.1kHz, then CD Wave, then FLAC [1]\n- **deadco2022-06-17**: taped by Jeff Travitz [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Boulder: [2022 Dead and Company poster Boulder Folsom Fueld 6/18/22 | #4477328338](https://www.worthpoint.com/worthopedia/2022-dead-company-poster-boulder-4477328338) [5]",
